{"type":"reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "Before I give my guidance on the executive-interview protocol, I need to put on the record a key fact I confirmed this morning. The implicated vice president has retained separate counsel and will not participate in a company interview without that counsel's written consent. I have not yet circulated this confirmation because I am waiting for the engagement letter to be filed. This is directly relevant to our executive-interview protocol decision, and I want everyone aware of it before we proceed."}
```

